---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="RunLearn — Cómo funciona una base de datos">
  <div class="api-page">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="topbar-main">
        <a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="Volver al inicio de RunLearn">
          <span class="brand-mark">RL</span>
          <span>RunLearn</span>
        </a>
        <div class="crumbs" aria-label="Ruta actual">
          <a href="/">Inicio</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Base de datos</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="topbar-actions">
        <a class="home-action" href="/" aria-label="Volver al inicio">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="m3 10.8 9-7.2 9 7.2"/>
            <path d="M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5"/>
            <path d="M9.5 20v-6h5v6"/>
          </svg>
          Inicio
        </a>
        <div class="badge-live"><span class="dot"></span>módulo interactivo</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1>Cómo funciona una base de datos</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Cada paso del diagrama corresponde a una acción real dentro de una base de datos. Tocá <strong>Simular funcionamiento</strong> y seguí el recorrido completo: desde una consulta <strong>SQL</strong> hasta las filas que vuelven listas para usar.
    </p>

    <div class="diagram-card">
      <div class="diagram" id="diagram">
        <svg class="lines">
          <line x1="9%" y1="50%" x2="91%" y2="50%" stroke="var(--api-line)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" />
        </svg>

        <div class="node" id="node-app" style="left:9%">
          <div class="icon-ring">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/>
              <path d="M8 9h8"/>
              <path d="M8 13h5"/>
              <path d="M8 17h3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="label">Aplicación</div>
        </div>

        <div class="node" id="node-query" style="left:36.3%">
          <div class="icon-ring">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M8 9 4 12l4 3"/>
              <path d="m16 9 4 3-4 3"/>
              <path d="M10 5h4"/>
              <path d="M9 19h6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="label">Consulta SQL</div>
        </div>

        <div class="node" id="node-index" style="left:63.7%">
          <div class="icon-ring">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="5.5"/>
              <path d="m15 15 4 4"/>
              <path d="M8 10.5h5"/>
              <path d="M10.5 8v5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="label">Índice</div>
        </div>

        <div class="node" id="node-table" style="left:91%">
          <div class="icon-ring">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="7" ry="2.6"/>
              <path d="M5 6v12c0 1.4 3.1 2.6 7 2.6s7-1.2 7-2.6V6"/>
              <path d="M5 12c0 1.4 3.1 2.6 7 2.6s7-1.2 7-2.6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="label">Tabla</div>
        </div>

        <div class="packet" id="packet"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="controls">
      <div class="controls-left">
        <button class="primary" id="btn-run">Simular funcionamiento</button>
        <button class="ghost" id="btn-reset">Reiniciar</button>
      </div>
      <div class="controls-left">
        <div class="step-track" id="step-track"></div>
        <span class="step-count" id="step-count">0 / 6</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span class="title">Código</span>
          <span class="filename" id="code-filename">consulta.sql</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="code" id="code-client"><span class="line" data-key="select"><span class="kw">SELECT</span> id, nombre, progreso</span>
<span class="line" data-key="from"><span class="kw">FROM</span> cursos</span>
<span class="line" data-key="where"><span class="kw">WHERE</span> usuario_id = 42</span>
<span class="line" data-key="order"><span class="kw">ORDER BY</span> actualizado_en <span class="kw">DESC</span></span></pre>
        <div class="code-divider"></div>
        <pre class="code" id="code-server"><span class="line" data-key="index"><span class="kw">CREATE INDEX</span> idx_cursos_usuario</span>
<span class="line" data-key="index">  <span class="kw">ON</span> cursos(usuario_id)</span>
<span class="line" data-key="rows">rows = engine.scan(index)</span>
<span class="line" data-key="return"><span class="kw">return</span> rows.toJSON()</span></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span class="title">Qué está pasando</span>
        </div>
        <div class="explain-body">
          <div id="explain-idle" class="explain-idle">
            Tocá «Simular funcionamiento» para arrancar. Vas a ver cómo la base de datos interpreta una consulta, usa un índice, lee la tabla y devuelve solo las filas que la aplicación necesita.
          </div>
          <div id="explain-active" style="display:none">
            <div class="explain-tag" id="explain-tag">petición</div>
            <div class="explain-text" id="explain-text"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="console-line" id="console-line" style="display:none"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
(function () {
  const steps = [
    {
      from: 'app', to: 'query', dir: 'request',
      code: 'select', panel: 'client', file: 'consulta.sql',
      text: 'La aplicación necesita información y arma una consulta. Con <strong>SELECT id, nombre, progreso</strong> pide columnas concretas, en vez de traer todo el registro.'
    },
    {
      from: 'query', to: 'query', dir: 'request',
      code: 'where', panel: 'client', file: 'consulta.sql',
      text: 'La condición <strong>WHERE usuario_id = 42</strong> filtra el conjunto de datos. Sin este filtro, la base tendría que revisar muchos más registros.'
    },
    {
      from: 'query', to: 'index', dir: 'request',
      code: 'index', panel: 'server', file: 'estructura.sql',
      text: 'El motor mira si existe un índice útil. <strong>idx_cursos_usuario</strong> funciona como un atajo: permite encontrar los cursos del usuario sin recorrer toda la tabla.'
    },
    {
      from: 'index', to: 'table', dir: 'request',
      code: 'rows', panel: 'server', file: 'motor-db',
      text: 'Con el índice resuelto, el motor lee las filas reales en la tabla <strong>cursos</strong>. Ahí viven los datos persistidos: nombres, progreso y fechas.'
    },
    {
      from: 'table', to: 'query', dir: 'response',
      code: 'order', panel: 'client', file: 'consulta.sql',
      text: 'Antes de responder, la base aplica <strong>ORDER BY actualizado_en DESC</strong>. El resultado queda ordenado para que la aplicación reciba primero lo más reciente.'
    },
    {
      from: 'query', to: 'app', dir: 'response',
      code: 'return', panel: 'server', file: 'motor-db',
      text: 'La base devuelve un conjunto de filas. El backend puede convertirlo con <strong>rows.toJSON()</strong> y enviarlo a la interfaz sin exponer cómo está guardada la tabla.',
      finalJson: true
    }
  ];

  const nodePos = { app: 9, query: 36.3, index: 63.7, table: 91 };

  const packet = document.getElementById('packet');
  const btnRun = document.getElementById('btn-run');
  const btnReset = document.getElementById('btn-reset');
  const stepTrack = document.getElementById('step-track');
  const stepCount = document.getElementById('step-count');
  const codeFilename = document.getElementById('code-filename');
  const explainIdle = document.getElementById('explain-idle');
  const explainActive = document.getElementById('explain-active');
  const explainTag = document.getElementById('explain-tag');
  const explainText = document.getElementById('explain-text');
  const consoleLine = document.getElementById('console-line');

  const allNodes = ['app', 'query', 'index', 'table'].map(id => document.getElementById('node-' + id));
  const allCodeLines = document.querySelectorAll('.line');

  // build step track
  steps.forEach((s, i) => {
    const seg = document.createElement('div');
    seg.className = 'seg';
    seg.dataset.index = i;
    seg.dataset.dir = s.dir;
    stepTrack.appendChild(seg);
  });
  const segs = stepTrack.querySelectorAll('.seg');

  let running = false;
  let currentStep = -1;

  function clearHighlights() {
    allNodes.forEach(n => n.classList.remove('active'));
    allCodeLines.forEach(l => l.classList.remove('active', 'response'));
  }

  function setNodeActive(id, color) {
    const node = document.getElementById('node-' + id);
    node.classList.add('active');
    node.style.setProperty('--node-color', color);
  }

  function renderStep(i) {
    const s = steps[i];
    const color = s.dir === 'request' ? 'var(--amber)' : 'var(--blue)';

    clearHighlights();
    setNodeActive(s.from, color);
    setNodeActive(s.to, color);

    // move packet
    packet.classList.add('visible');
    packet.style.background = s.dir === 'request' ? 'var(--amber)' : 'var(--blue)';
    packet.style.left = nodePos[s.from] + '%';
    // force reflow so the transition triggers from the correct start point
    void packet.offsetWidth;
    packet.style.left = nodePos[s.to] + '%';

    // highlight code line + switch panel emphasis
    document.querySelectorAll('.line[data-key="' + s.code + '"]').forEach(l => {
      l.classList.add('active');
      if (s.dir === 'response') l.classList.add('response');
    });
    codeFilename.textContent = s.file;

    // explain panel
    explainIdle.style.display = 'none';
    explainActive.style.display = 'block';
    explainTag.textContent = s.dir === 'request' ? 'petición →' : '← respuesta';
    explainTag.className = 'explain-tag' + (s.dir === 'response' ? ' response' : '');
    explainText.innerHTML = s.text;

    if (s.finalJson) {
      consoleLine.style.display = 'block';
      consoleLine.innerHTML = '[{ <span class="json-key">"id"</span>: 7, <span class="json-key">"nombre"</span>: <span class="json-str">"SQL básico"</span>, <span class="json-key">"progreso"</span>: 68 }]';
    } else {
      consoleLine.style.display = 'none';
    }

    // step track
    segs.forEach((seg, idx) => {
      seg.classList.toggle('done', idx <= i);
      seg.classList.toggle('response', seg.dataset.dir === 'response');
    });
    stepCount.textContent = (i + 1) + ' / ' + steps.length;
  }

  function runNext() {
    currentStep++;
    if (currentStep >= steps.length) {
      running = false;
      btnRun.disabled = false;
      btnRun.textContent = 'Simular de nuevo';
      return;
    }
    renderStep(currentStep);
    setTimeout(runNext, 1500);
  }

  function start() {
    if (running) return;
    running = true;
    btnRun.disabled = true;
    reset(false);
    setTimeout(runNext, 250);
  }

  function reset(clearButton = true) {
    running = false;
    currentStep = -1;
    clearHighlights();
    packet.classList.remove('visible');
    explainIdle.style.display = 'block';
    explainActive.style.display = 'none';
    consoleLine.style.display = 'none';
    codeFilename.textContent = 'consulta.sql';
    segs.forEach(seg => seg.classList.remove('done'));
    stepCount.textContent = '0 / ' + steps.length;
    if (clearButton) {
      btnRun.disabled = false;
      btnRun.textContent = 'Simular funcionamiento';
    }
  }

  btnRun.addEventListener('click', start);
  btnReset.addEventListener('click', () => reset(true));

  reset(true);
})();
</script>

<style>
  .api-page {
    --api-panel: var(--surface-panel);
    --api-panel-2: var(--surface-card);
    --api-border: var(--border-subtle);
    --api-border-soft: var(--border-hairline);
    --api-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    --api-muted: var(--text-secondary);
    --api-muted-2: var(--text-muted);
    --amber: var(--color-db);
    --amber-soft: var(--color-db-glow);
    --blue: var(--brand-blue);
    --blue-soft: var(--brand-blue-glow);

    width: min(100%, 980px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0.35rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 4px 2px 26px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--api-border-soft);
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .topbar-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .brand-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    width: fit-content;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .brand-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-white);
  }

  .brand-mark {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--canvas-bg);
    background: var(--amber);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--amber-soft);
  }

  .topbar-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .home-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 34px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--api-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color .15s, border-color .15s, background .15s, transform .15s;
  }

  .home-action svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .home-action:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .home-action:active {
    transform: scale(.98);
  }

  .home-action:focus-visible,
  .brand-link:focus-visible,
  .crumbs a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--amber);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .crumbs {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .crumbs .sep {
    color: var(--api-muted-2);
  }

  .crumbs .current {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .crumbs a {
    color: var(--api-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .crumbs a:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .badge-live {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--amber);
    background: var(--amber-soft);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 28%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 5px 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .badge-live .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--amber);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
  }

  .lede strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .diagram-card {
    background: var(--api-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--api-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 34px 28px 26px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--glass-highlight);
  }

  .diagram {
    position: relative;
    height: 108px;
    margin: 0 6px 4px;
  }

  .diagram svg.lines {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .node {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
  }

  .node .icon-ring {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: var(--api-panel-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--api-border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    transition: border-color .25s, color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
  }

  .node.active .icon-ring {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-color: var(--node-color, var(--amber));
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--node-color, var(--amber)) 16%, transparent);
  }

  .node .icon-ring svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .node .label {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .node.active .label {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .packet {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background: var(--amber);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 20%, transparent);
    transition: left .85s cubic-bezier(.62,.04,.38,.96), background-color .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .packet.visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }

  .controls-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  button.primary {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--canvas-bg);
    background: var(--amber);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .15s, filter .15s;
  }

  button.primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
  }

  button.primary:active {
    transform: scale(.97);
  }

  button.primary:disabled {
    opacity: .4;
    cursor: default;
    transform: none;
  }

  button.ghost {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--api-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color .15s, border-color .15s;
  }

  button.ghost:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .step-track {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .step-track .seg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--api-border);
    transition: background .25s;
  }

  .step-track .seg.done {
    background: var(--amber);
  }

  .step-track .seg.done.response {
    background: var(--blue);
  }

  .step-count {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--api-muted-2);
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .panel {
    background: var(--api-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--api-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--glass-highlight);
  }

  .panel-head {
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--api-border-soft);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .panel-head .title {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .panel-head .filename {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--api-muted-2);
  }

  pre.code {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 20px 22px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--api-muted);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  pre.code .kw {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  pre.code .fn {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  pre.code .line {
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1px 8px;
    margin: 0 -8px;
    transition: background .3s, color .3s;
  }

  pre.code .line.active {
    background: var(--amber-soft);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  pre.code .line.active.response {
    background: var(--blue-soft);
  }

  pre.code .line.active .fn {
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  pre.code .line.active.response .fn {
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .code-divider {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--api-border-soft);
  }

  .explain-body {
    padding: 20px;
    min-height: 210px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .explain-text {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .explain-idle {
    color: var(--api-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .explain-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--amber);
    background: var(--amber-soft);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .explain-tag.response {
    color: var(--blue);
    background: var(--blue-soft);
  }

  .console-line {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
